## Real-World Use Case

A data analytics company:
- Uploads 10,000+ logs per day from IoT devices.
- Enables versioning so that deletions/overwrites can be recovered during audits or investigations.
- Applies a lifecycle policy so logs are moved to Glacier after 30 days and permanently deleted after 1 year.
- Uses S3 Standard for incoming logs, and Glacier/Deep Archive for historical compliance.
- Enforces encryption and limits access through strict IAM and bucket policies.
- Runs Athena queries directly on the latest log data.

---

## Summary
Amazon S3 provides industry-leading scalability, data availability, security, and performance. With versioning and lifecycle management, you can optimize storage cost, maintain compliance, and ensure data durability for all your cloud workloads.